  "goodToKnow": "Die Offenheit means openness or frankness: Offenheit für Neues, in aller Offenheit (in all frankness). Germans are often described as direct: they tend to give honest feedback without much padding, which some foreigners find blunt and others find refreshing. Ganz offen gesagt means to be perfectly frank. Offen means open, both literally and figuratively: eine offene Tür, ein offener Mensch. It has no plural."
